n:at("Sends rows into the shared Delay B bus.","Delay B is the shared clocked/multitap delay destination. Drag one cell to set how much that source feeds Delay B, or drag the Delay B header to trim all editable Delay B sends together.",[Fn("FX Routing Matrix","Delay B Column")]),routingMatrixGranularColumn:at("Sends rows into the shared Granular processor.","The Granular column controls the feed into the granular bus. Drag one cell to adjust one source-to-granular send, or drag the Granular header to trim every editable granular feed together.",[Fn("FX Routing Matrix","Granular Column")]),routingMatrixDegradeColumn:at("Sends rows into the shared Degrade processor.","The Degrade column controls the feed into the parent Degrade engine, where Drift and Erosion shape the return. Drag one cell to adjust one send, or drag the Degrade header to trim every editable Degrade feed together.",[Fn("FX Routing Matrix","Degrade Column")]),routingMatrixFreezeColumn:at("Sends rows into the shared Spectral Freeze processor.","The Freeze column controls the independent feed into Spectral Freeze. Drag one cell to adjust one source send, or drag the Freeze header to trim every editable Freeze feed together.",[Fn("FX Routing Matrix","Freeze Column")]),routingMatrixReverbColumn:at("Sends rows into the shared Reverb return.","The Reverb column controls how much each source feeds the shared reverb tail. Drag one cell for a single source, or drag the Reverb header to trim every editable reverb send together. Degrade can feed Reverb, but that disables the reverse Reverb-to-Degrade route.",[Fn("FX Routing Matrix","Reverb Column")]),routingMatrixSaturationColumn:at("Sends FX returns into the shared creative Saturator.","The Saturator column controls processor-to-processor feeds into creative saturation. Adjust individual FX cells; direct sound-source routing is unavailable because Product Core exposes this as an FX graph destination.",[Fn("FX Routing Matrix","Saturator Column")]),routingMatrixT